      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Take upward as positive. The initial velocity is −5.2 m s⁻¹ and the final velocity is +3.6 m s⁻¹.",
        "The momentum change is Δp = m(v − u) = 0.25[3.6 − (−5.2)].",
        "Δp = 2.2 kg m s⁻¹ upward, so its magnitude is 2.2 kg m s⁻¹."
      ],
      "checking": {
        "mode": "ai",
        "deterministic_checks": [],
        "full_marks_if_all_deterministic_checks_pass": false,
