            "observable": "Uses p = mv with the reversal of direction, giving Δp = 0.25 × (3.6 + 5.2)."
          },
          {
            "criterion_id": "9702_s25_22_q04_b_i_mp02",
            "observable": "Obtains a momentum-change magnitude of 2.2 kg m s⁻¹."
          }
        ]
